===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# The [[formulation]] of [[general]] [[concept]]s from [[specific]] [[instance]]s by [[abstracting]] [[common]] [[properties]].
# [[inductive|Inductive]] [[reasoning]] from detailed [[fact]]s to general [[principle]]s.

